<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP says 6-month coal shipments rise.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP says 6-month coal shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Tuesday its total shipments of coal rose 1.6 percent to 24.496 million tonnes in the six months to November 30 compared to the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>In the quarter to Nov 30 coal shipments were up 4.5 percent from a year ago at 12.963 million tonnes, BHP said.</p>
<p>In the latest half-year, shipments to Japan accounted for 26.3 percent of the total, to Europe 21.6 percent and to other destinations 52.1 percent, BHP said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
